{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.047215085870573992,"w":0.081097857157389264,"x":0.82918728865135094,"h":0.015721882057752601,"t":"Reading","c":1},{"h":0.020064803492003125,"t":"For a conversation, both speakers need to have devices called Pilots (translator earpieces) in","x":0.075911223368820224,"y":0.093767087750444289,"w":0.78453720092773449,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.07586685139627955,"t":"their ears. 'We find that there's a barrier with sharing one of the earphones with a stranger,'","y":0.110421205219143,"w":0.77643849690755207,"h":0.020853648002872038},{"h":0.019621834994065668,"c":1,"y":0.12920370047407048,"t":"says Ochoa. That can't have been totally unexpected. The problem would be solved if earpiece","w":0.80718027750651045,"x":0.075871821596658715},{"x":0.075895445482100754,"t":"translators became sufficiently prevalent that strangers would be likely to already have their own","w":0.82356775919596337,"h":0.019256990145792963,"y":0.14729112652272258,"c":1},{"h":0.018474228332879594,"t":"in their ears. Whether that happens, and how quickly, will probably depend not so much on the","w":0.80708735148111976,"y":0.16556004187094564,"c":1,"x":0.075923896530413607},{"y":0.18024750505851106,"h":0.02308357486331003,"t":"earpieces themselves, but on the prevalence of voice-controlled devices and artificial translation","x":0.075812548044022682,"w":0.81755198160807285,"c":1},{"y":0.203286870780095,"c":1,"h":0.017544997898878312,"w":0.095520280202229829,"x":0.075395927186431039,"t":"in general."},{"y":0.23687315632295669,"c":1,"t":"Waibel highlights the significance of certain Asian nations, noting that voice translation has","x":0.078028752491969916,"w":0.75770019531249999,"h":0.017487308761011566},{"t":"really taken off in countries such as Japan with a range of systems. There is still a long way to go,","h":0.018863996432594177,"c":1,"x":0.073873140881008895,"y":0.25448555863466249,"w":0.81527699788411445},{"w":0.82365122477213548,"h":0.022296522922572226,"x":0.075860014746591375,"c":1,"y":0.27069959647603148,"t":"though. A translation system needs to be simultaneous, like the translator's voice speaking over the"},{"c":1,"x":0.07586991898203109,"w":0.82155685424804692,"h":0.021603152744889553,"t":"foreign politician being interviewed on the TV, rather than in sections that oblige speakers to pause","y":0.28799740011601649},{"t":"after every few remarks and wait for the translation to be delivered. It needs to work offline, for","w":0.79480478922526043,"y":0.30806827434678374,"h":0.019558902616697793,"c":1,"x":0.075908810358365594},{"w":0.8069815063476562,"h":0.018961376989133916,"y":0.32558139584227463,"c":1,"x":0.075975365877917228,"t":"situations where internet access isn't possible, and to address apprehensions about the amount of"},{"h":0.018923646369866542,"w":0.74332646687825521,"c":1,"y":0.34302325607497819,"x":0.07597537143766904,"t":"private speech data accumulating in the cloud, having been sent to servers for processing."},{"t":"Systems not only need to cope with physical challenges such as noise, they will also need to be","x":0.075975353409661467,"c":1,"w":0.81108830769856777,"h":0.01745129306759452,"y":0.37935103248144642},{"t":"socially aware by addressing people in the right way. Some cultural traditions demand solemn","h":0.020484942320877164,"c":1,"y":0.39591492627774538,"x":0.075851521970410729,"w":0.8030931091308593},{"h":0.019008870532730704,"x":0.075901426440267608,"t":"respect for academic status, for example, and it is only polite to respect this. Etiquette-sensitive","y":0.41515342239988695,"c":1,"w":0.81123891194661457},{"y":0.43266014320766333,"w":0.80915715535481769,"c":1,"t":"artificial translators could relieve people of the need to know these differing cultural norms. At","x":0.075911464932529302,"h":0.018723654395359501},{"t":"the same time, they might help to preserve local customs, slowing the spread of habits associated","y":0.45015548248383941,"w":0.82772801717122391,"h":0.021292451841641302,"x":0.075881233004026188,"c":1},{"t":"with international English, such as its readiness to get on first-name terms.","x":0.078028748577612009,"y":0.46947674419993279,"w":0.63449691772460937,"h":0.017543904689912626,"c":1},{"h":0.019200982738033612,"t":"Professors and other professionals will not outsource language awareness to software, though. If","x":0.075916324596209867,"w":0.82355458577473961,"y":0.50396894006595938,"c":1},{"w":0.82546198527018233,"c":1,"y":0.52180232584241992,"h":0.018905638523158075,"t":"the technology matures into seamless, ubiquitous artificial speech translation, it will actually add","x":0.075975379079487759},{"y":0.53923303839315373,"w":0.80492813110351569,"h":0.018906495986083183,"c":1,"x":0.078028747499892762,"t":"value to language skills. Whether it will help people conduct their family lives or relationships"},{"x":0.075895702097330681,"y":0.55713722891187978,"h":0.019878779048413397,"t":"is open to question - though one noteworthy possibility is that it could overcome the language","c":1,"w":0.80508122762044265},{"c":1,"x":0.075890548854715315,"w":0.74148508707682292,"t":"barriers that often arise between generations after migration, leaving children and their","y":0.57404103117362082,"h":0.022619959738402251},{"c":1,"y":0.59439528051518142,"h":0.017523323891788678,"w":0.3470225779215495,"x":0.078028753929368977,"t":"grandparents without a shared language."},{"c":1,"y":0.62820121905393989,"h":0.020970153808593794,"w":0.76815831502278653,"t":"Whatever uses it is put to, though, it will never be as good as the real thing. Even if voice-","x":0.077938110145845202},{"c":1,"y":0.64650113928985864,"w":0.77220662434895826,"h":0.019635180808098229,"t":"morphing technology simulates the speaker's voice, their lip movements won't match, and","x":0.07795530684961724},{"w":0.79914779663085933,"h":0.023058062528087064,"c":1,"y":0.66151934868777651,"t":"they will look like they are in a dubbed movie. The contrast will underline the value of shared","x":0.077840073916061486},{"w":0.82153996785481775,"y":0.68155332626023435,"c":1,"h":0.021270040776525612,"t":"languages, and the value of learning them. Sharing a language can promote a sense of belonging","x":0.075892058709389018},{"t":"and community, as with the international scientists who use English as a lingua franca, where","x":0.078028740815563352,"h":0.017441860412777732,"c":1,"y":0.70203488374437417,"w":0.79466120402018237},{"x":0.077974685088547824,"h":0.018666181311143171,"t":"their predecessors used Latin. Though the practical need for a common language will diminish,","y":0.71835904284481955,"w":0.81117584228515627,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.81951746622721344,"x":0.077918884650499745,"h":0.020595158939867964,"t":"the social value of sharing one will persist. And software will never be a substitute for the subtle","y":0.73510412003184322},{"t":"but vital understanding that comes with knowledge of a language.","w":0.56262832641601557,"x":0.078028752491855327,"h":0.016050113126591659,"c":1,"y":0.75575221233334089},{"c":1,"t":"71","w":0.02669404347737625,"y":0.92296511651460966,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.88501026769663027},{"h":0.047780971470835598,"y":0.939023246385844,"w":0.45180328369140621,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51825223579186064}]}